      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Smart filly COMEANDSEE (9) makes her first appearance since a brave effort in the Group 1 Protostar in Brisbane in July where she led and boxed on for fourth. That was her first defeat having impressed in winning her first three outings in Victoria. Readied with an easy trial win at Melton and is well placed against her own sex. ATOMIK GO ANNA (4) took advantage of the ace draw to lead and win well when resuming at this circuit and distance. Draws wider and faces a smart one but she won her only previous second-up attempt so should be improved. SABALENKA (3) has had two months off since scoring last start by 4.7 metres at Hobart but was kept up to the mark with a trial and draws well. FRITH IN FLIGHT (5) deserves respect after overcoming a back row draw to score last time, giving her two wins and placing from her last three outings here.",
